  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a contribution to the achievement of the Developing Darfur: A Recovery and Reconstruction Strategy (DDS) and will be funded by Qatar under the UN Fund for Recovery Reconstruction and Development in Darfur. It is implemented as a joint UN programme , whereby UNIDO will contribute to develop and implement training courses on solar systems in Vocational Training Centres in Darfur.</narrative>
